  "claim": "Helen Elizabeth Hunt won more awards than Dan Schneider.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Dan Schneider (TV producer). Sentence: Dan Schneider (born January 14, 1966) is an American actor, television and film writer, and producer.\nPage: Dan Schneider (TV producer). Sentence: After appearing in mostly supporting roles in a number of 1980s and 1990s films and TV shows, Schneider devoted himself to behind-the-scenes work in production.\nPage: Dan Schneider (TV producer). Sentence: He is the co-president of television production company Schneider's Bakery.\nPage: Dan Schneider (TV producer). Sentence: He created/co-created \"All That\", \"The Amanda Show\", \"What I Like About You\", \"Drake & Josh\", \"Zoey 101\", \"iCarly\", \"Victorious\", \"Sam & Cat\", \"Henry Danger\", \"Game Shakers\", and \"The Adventures of Kid Danger and Captain Man\".\nPage: Helen Hunt. Sentence: Helen Elizabeth Hunt (born June 15, 1963) is an American actress, director, and screenwriter.\nPage: Helen Hunt. Sentence: She starred in the sitcom \"Mad About You\" for seven years, and played single mother Carol Connelly in the 1997 romantic comedy film \"As Good as It Gets\", for which she won the Academy Award for Best Actress.\nPage: Helen Hunt. Sentence: Hunt has also won four Emmy Awards, four Golden Globe Awards, and two Screen Actors Guild Awards.",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Dan Schneider (TV producer). Sentence: Dan Schneider (born January 14, 1966) is an American actor, television and film writer, and producer.\nPage: Dan Schneider (TV producer). Sentence: After appearing in mostly supporting roles in a number of 1980s and 1990s films and TV shows, Schneider devoted himself to behind-the-scenes work in production.\nPage: Dan Schneider (TV producer). Sentence: He is the co-president of television production company Schneider's Bakery.\nPage: Dan Schneider (TV producer). Sentence: He created/co-created \"All That\", \"The Amanda Show\", \"What I Like About You\", \"Drake & Josh\", \"Zoey 101\", \"iCarly\", \"Victorious\", \"Sam & Cat\", \"Henry Danger\", \"Game Shakers\", and \"The Adventures of Kid Danger and Captain Man\".\nPage: Helen Hunt. Sentence: Helen Elizabeth Hunt (born June 15, 1963) is an American actress, director, and screenwriter.\nPage: Helen Hunt. Sentence: She starred in the sitcom \"Mad About You\" for seven years, and played single mother Carol Connelly in the 1997 romantic comedy film \"As Good as It Gets\", for which she won the Academy Award for Best Actress.\nPage: Helen Hunt. Sentence: Hunt has also won four Emmy Awards, four Golden Globe Awards, and two Screen Actors Guild Awards.",
